      "notes": "MIDI controller list (page 22 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord Electro 4 HPSW English User Manual v1.1x Edition F.pdf (sha256 e260198d76eac018c4a58c53c89eb042c3863b3fa44e20e42bf26a2dbbe4f4ff), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/208/Nord%20Electro%204%20HPSW%20English%20User%20Manual%20v1.1x%20Edition%20F.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 64 Sustain Pedal, 11 Control Pedal."
  ],
